id":"dbrrbd_p7_160","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#160","p":7,"im":["db6ff97567466881591d6a37e926943fa153eba0"],"ib":{"db6ff97567466881591d6a37e926943fa153eba0":0},"m":160},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_161","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#161","p":7,"im":["f4f3dc1c7c03599a86037edd9cac72a8a4733356"],"ib":{"f4f3dc1c7c03599a86037edd9cac72a8a4733356":0},"m":161},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_162","t":"CHART1:\n\nCHART 2:\n\nCHART 3:\n\nCHART 4:\n\nCHART 5:","a":"Bushido","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#162","p":7,"im":["7c8b3d5828f63361ce7edc8b1f7b58de03418067","0c7f72559ec1c258e4555bb0332798b46236b04e","999e011efa3c38d6575dd6873d9e6bdafbb5c19d","a2b6c581930af171b5eb317bc7cd281f689d5761","fd910146dc8185c55054a1662f92228bb1845170"],"fa":"چارت 1:\n\nچارت 2:\n\nچارت 3:\n\nچارت 4:\n\nچارت 5:","ib":{"7c8b3d5828f63361ce7edc8b1f7b58de03418067":1,"0c7f72559ec1c258e4555bb0332798b46236b04e":2,"999e011efa3c38d6575dd6873d9e6bdafbb5c19d":3,"a2b6c581930af171b5eb317bc7cd281f689d5761":4,"fd910146dc8185c55054a1662f92228bb1845170":5},"m":162},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_163","t":"Please comment","a":"pipextract","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#163","p":7,"im":["8c930a8fd06dd88312772c84d1a9421080a2a1c2"],"fa":"لطفاً نظر بدهید","ib":{"8c930a8fd06dd88312772c84d1a9421080a2a1c2":0},"m":163},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_164","t":"It's a great start\n\nSome notes on chart","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","r":"Grand Master","n":"#164","p":7,"im":["5f30aca1a23211f602fc302f9db58452d0b7e7f7"],"fa":"شروع خوبی است\n\nچند نکته روی چارت","ib":{"5f30aca1a23211f602fc302f9db58452d0b7e7f7":2},"m":164},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_165","t":"Long term chart,EURUSD weekly..\n\nDoing this on hindsight is very easy.... But in real-time,I'm still struggling in determining whether a supply or demand area will hold or not. The best thing that I can do for now is finding very signficant levels only (using Sam Seiden odd enhancer), and put a limit order at this levels (touch trade entry).\n\nAll comments are welcomed, thank you..","a":"Neopips","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#165","p":7,"im":["c37d557567a4943f330fef46fe0711d47c4a00e9"],"fa":"چارت بلندمدت، EURUSD هفتگی…\n\nانجام این کار با نگاه به گذشته خیلی آسان است… اما در زمان واقعی، من هنوز در تشخیص اینکه ناحیهٔ عرضه یا تقاضا نگه می‌دارد یا نه گیر کرده‌ام. بهترین کاری که فعلاً می‌توانم بکنم پیدا کردن فقط سطوح خیلی مهم است (با استفاده از odd enhancer سام سایدن) و گذاشتن سفارش لیمیت روی این سطوح (ورود لیمیت با اولین برخورد).\n\nاز همهٔ نظرات استقبال می‌کنم، ممنون…","ib":{"c37d557567a4943f330fef46fe0711d47c4a00e9":1},"m":165},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_166","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#166","p":7,"im":["cfb52b7790f6bd942875840807fa7428095cb967"],"ib":{"cfb52b7790f6bd942875840807fa7428095cb967":0},"m":166},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_167","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#167","p":7,"im":["bbf00329e5dcfb1c1824e1cb5434ece8fe7abf18"],"ib":{"bbf00329e5dcfb1c1824e1cb5434ece8fe7abf18":0},"m":167},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_168","t":"Nice work Ashkan, although there are dozens of significant RBDs and DBRs that you missed - please be aware of them\n\nHere are a couple of big ones","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","r":"Grand Master","n":"#168","p":7,"im":["f1a99482b4341bad238b760159af1c928f1c7d93"],"fa":"کار خوبی بود Ashkan، هرچند ده‌ها RBD و DBR مهم را از دست دادی — لطفاً حواست به آن‌ها باشد\n\nاین‌ها چند مورد بزرگ‌تر است","ib":{"f1a99482b4341bad238b760159af1c928f1c7d93":2},"m":168},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_169","t":"Ifmyante wrote: Nice work Ashkan, although there are dozens of significant RBDs and DBRs that you missed - please be aware of them\n\nHere are a couple of big ones\n\nHi IF\n\nYes, you're right. I missed important RBDs and DBRs. I'll continue to post my homework. Please comment on my charts. I need your help and experience to improve my trading style.\n\nRegards, Ashkan","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#169","p":7,"im":["f1a99482b4341bad238b760159af1c928f1c7d93"],"fa":"Ifmyante نوشت: کار خوبی بود Ashkan، هرچند ده‌ها RBD و DBR مهم را از دست دادی — لطفاً حواست به آن‌ها باشد\n\nاین‌ها چند مورد بزرگ‌تر است\n\nسلام IF\n\nبله، حق با توست. RBD‌ها و DBR‌های مهمی را از دست دادم. ادامه می‌دهم و تکالیفم را می‌گذارم. لطفاً روی چارت‌هایم نظر بده. برای بهتر کردن سبک معامله‌گری‌ام به کمک و تجربهٔ تو نیاز دارم.\n\nبا احترام، Ashkan","ib":{"f1a99482b4341bad238b760159af1c928f1c7d93":2},"m":169},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_170","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#170","p":7,"im":["a8b2410c13c88a4eb41060b5e211c5d631d7101e"],"ib":{"a8b2410c13c88a4eb41060b5e211c5d631d7101e":0},"m":170},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_171","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#171","p":7,"im":["b12df17bb07dad2f59c76a6fd60820fccb1b2d81"],"ib":{"b12df17bb07dad2f59c76a6fd60820fccb1b2d81":0},"m":171},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_172","t":"13 OF 20","a":"hornet","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#172","p":7,"im":["8285514cd59f7fa73fb104273fd188e2f3daa3d5"],"fa":"13 از 20","ib":{"8285514cd59f7fa73fb104273fd188e2f3daa3d5":1},"m":172},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_173","t":"14 OF 20","a":"hornet","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#173","p":7,"im":["3fdce6b9c78060e8a9e5e6d3eda12d9f2684523c"],"fa":"14 از 20","ib":{"3fdce6b9c78060e8a9e5e6d3eda12d9f2684523c":1},"m":173},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_174","t":"Neopips wrote:\n\nDoing this on hindsight is very easy.... But in real-time,I'm still struggling in determining whether a supply or demand area will hold or not\n\nI second that comment, it is very easy but still too difficult","a":"hornet","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#174","p":7,"im":[],"fa":"Neopips نوشت:\n\nانجام این کار با نگاه به گذشته خیلی آسان است… اما در زمان واقعی، من هنوز در تشخیص اینکه ناحیهٔ عرضه یا تقاضا نگه می‌دارد یا نه گیر کرده‌ام\n\nمن هم همین را می‌گویم؛ ساده است، اما هنوز بیش از حد دشوار","m":174},{"id":"dbrrbd_p7_175","t":"","a":"Ashkan","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#175","p":7,"im":["6ee8b447edb88a9e3d6f786b0ef80de7853ccc82"],"ib":{"6ee8b447edb88a9e3d6f786b0ef80de7853ccc82":0},"m":175}],"images":[{"k":"7c8b3d5828f63361ce7edc8b1f7b58de03418067","t":"assets/thumbs/7c8b3d5828f63361ce7edc8b1f7b58de03418067.webp","f":"assets/images/7c8b3d5828f63361ce7edc8